*~

# VS Code - Machine-specific, regenerated by .githooks/post-checkout
# CRITICAL: .vscode/settings.json AND .vscode/mcp.json contain platform-specific Python paths:
#   - macOS/Linux: .venv/bin/python
#   - Windows: .venv/Scripts/python.exe
# Committing these files causes cross-platform breakage for team collaboration.
# Each developer's machine regenerates its own via: python .cortex-runtime/setup-mcp.py
# The post-checkout hook runs this automatically on git pull/checkout.
.vscode/

