# Git hooks (machine-specific security)
# Office machine: Strict proprietary data leakage prevention
# Personal machines: No hooks needed (CORTEX-only work)
# These hooks are LOCAL to office machine and should NOT propagate
# EXCEPTION: CORTEX-specific hooks for MCP policy enforcement (Phase 50)
.githooks/*
!.githooks/.gitkeep
!.githooks/pre-commit
!.githooks/post-checkout
!.githooks/pre-commit-wiring-validator
!.githooks/pre-push

tests/_archive/

